# One line ending on both hosts: the files cross between Windows and the VPS through Syncthing, and a checkout that
# rewrote them to CRLF would appear as edits on the other host and change every input hash.
* text=auto eol=lf
# These compatibility fixtures are hashed as bytes; keep them identical across Windows/Linux checkouts.
tools/fixtures/migration-120-20260925/*.xml -text
